# This repository verifies byte digests across machines (profile SHA-256
# chain, reference WEM, stage-records hashes). Text files must therefore check
# out with identical bytes on every platform: checkout line endings are
# pinned to LF regardless of a machine's core.autocrlf (Windows runners
# otherwise rewrite JSON to CRLF and every checksum verification fails).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads and checked hashes: never touch bytes.
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.wem binary
*.so binary
*.pyd binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.abi3.so binary
*.whl binary

# Reference assets are already covered by *.bin/*.wem/*.wav above.
